  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Silo?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5f/Silo.png/revision/latest?cb=20250926033422\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Silo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Silo</figcaption></figure> \n<p>The <b>silo </b>is the building where <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crops</a> are stored, including berries, fruit and <a href=\"/wiki/peanuts-33962\" title=\"Peanuts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">peanuts</a>. It is already standing at the start of the game, but must be repaired during the tutorial to become usable.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The appearance of the silo changes as the player upgrades it. Its final appearance is displayed when the silo can store at least 300 items.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASilo_Broken.png\" title=\"Silo Broken.png (145 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/ed/Silo_Broken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191026014625\" title=\"Silo Broken.png (145 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Silo Broken.png (145 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASilo_Stage_1.png\" title=\"Silo Stage 1.png (153 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/18/Silo_Stage_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20150713084904\" title=\"Silo Stage 1.png (153 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Silo Stage 1.png (153 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASilo_Stage_2.png\" title=\"Silo Stage 2.png (179 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7e/Silo_Stage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191026015117\" title=\"Silo Stage 2.png (179 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Silo Stage 2.png (179 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ASilo_Stage_3.png\" title=\"Silo Stage 3.png (203 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/94/Silo_Stage_3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191026014618\" title=\"Silo Stage 3.png (203 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Silo Stage 3.png (203 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ASilo.png\" title=\"Silo.png (228 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5f/Silo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250926033422\" title=\"Silo.png (228 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Silo.png (228 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p>The silo can initially hold 50 items. Upgrading it increases its capacity:\n</p>\n<ul><li>by 25 spaces from 50 to 1,000</li>\n<li>by 50 spaces from 1,000 upwards without limit</li></ul>\n<p>Each upgrade requires the same number of nails, screws and wood panels but the number of items required increases by 1 with each upgrade (see the table below).\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ANail.png\" title=\"Nail.png (35 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/40/Nail.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028130907\" title=\"Nail.png (35 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Nail\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Nail.png (35 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Nail\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/nail-6712\" title=\"Nail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nail</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3AScrew.png\" title=\"Screw.png (14 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/59/Screw.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130937\" title=\"Screw.png (14 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Screw\" height=\"99\" width=\"99\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Screw.png (14 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Screw\" height=\"99\" width=\"99\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/screw-6711\" title=\"Screw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Screw</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AWood_Panel.png\" title=\"Wood Panel.png (15 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/02/Wood_Panel.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028131042\" title=\"Wood Panel.png (15 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Wood panel\" height=\"144\" width=\"144\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Wood Panel.png (15 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Wood panel\" height=\"144\" width=\"144\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/wood-panel-2872\" title=\"Wood Panel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wood panel</a></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading table</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Capacity from-to\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/40/Nail.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130907\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Nail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>+<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/59/Screw.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130937\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screw\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>+<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/02/Wood_Panel.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028131042\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wood Panel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>50-75</b></td>\n<td>x1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>75-100</b></td>\n<td>x2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>100-125</b></td>\n<td>x3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>125-150</b></td>\n<td>x4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>150-175</b></td>\n<td>x5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>175-200</b></td>\n<td>x6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>200-225</b></td>\n<td>x7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>225-250</b></td>\n<td>x8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>250-275</b></td>\n<td>x9\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>275-300</b></td>\n<td>x10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>300-325</b></td>\n<td>x11\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>325-350</b></td>\n<td>x12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>etc.</b></td>\n<td><b>etc.</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1000-1050</b></td>\n<td>x39\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1050-1100</b></td>\n<td>x40\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1100-1150</b></td>\n<td>x41\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1150-1200</b></td>\n<td>x42\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1200-1250</b></td>\n<td>x43\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1250-1300</b></td>\n<td>x44\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1300-1350</b></td>\n<td>x45\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1350-1400</b></td>\n<td>x46\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1400-1450</b></td>\n<td>x47\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1450-1500</b></td>\n<td>x48\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>etc.</b></td>\n<td><b>etc.</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Players can also calculate the number of each silo upgrade item (N) for each silo capacity (C) from formulas:\n</p><p><span class=\"mwe-math-element\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\">\n  \n    \n      \n        C\n        =\n        \n          {\n          \n            \n              \n                25\n                (\n                N\n                +\n                2\n                )\n              \n              \n                for&#xa0;\n                75\n                &#x2264;<!-- ≤ -->\n                C\n                &#x2264;<!-- ≤ -->\n                1\n                ,\n                000\n              \n            \n            \n              \n                50\n                (\n                N\n                &#x2212;<!-- − -->\n                18\n                )\n              \n              \n                for&#xa0;\n                C\n                &#x2265;<!-- ≥ -->\n                1\n                ,\n                000\n              \n            \n          \n          \n        \n      \n    \n    {\\displaystyle \\text{C} = \\begin{cases} 25(N+2)  &amp; \\text{for }75\\le C\\le1,000 \\\\  50(N-18) &amp; \\text{for }C \\geq1,000 \\end{cases}\n}\n  \n</span><img src=\"https://services.fandom.com/mathoid-facade/v1/media/math/render/svg/b3e32e133aa3b6bf1cc1dc1e9f0eb0fff6e0c15b\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" alt=\"{\\displaystyle {\\text{C}}={\\begin{cases}25(N+2)&amp;amp;{\\text{for }}75\\leq C\\leq 1,000\\\\50(N-18)&amp;amp;{\\text{for }}C\\geq 1,000\\end{cases}}}\" loading=\"lazy\"></span>\n</p><p>For example, from the table, if you would like to upgrade silo capacity from 275 to 300, you need to use 10 nails, 10 screws, and 10 wood panels. \n</p><p>The calculation shows as follow: C = 300 = 25 (N+2) --&gt; 12 = N+2 --&gt; N = 10\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>The silo is only used to store crops. There are more than 40 different types of crops. If you want to keep at least 30 of each at all times your silo needs to be able to hold more than 1,200 items. You also need to keep some room for more, as boat orders can ask for great quantities of one crop.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>As with Experience and Reputation, your silo (as well as your barn and tackle box) are often referred to by their level. The level of your silo is the number of each tool needed for your next upgrade. For example: You start the game with a level 1 silo which has a capacity of 50. A level 39 silo has a capacity of 1,000, after which future upgrades increase the capacity by 50. A level 241 silo would have a capacity of 11,100.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Barn.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250926033811\" title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo (228 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5f/Silo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250926033422\" title=\"Silo (228 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Silo (228 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box (31 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Tackle_Box.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191028143616\" title=\"Tackle Box (31 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Tackle Box (31 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829020255\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 416/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 553/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 40/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 13190/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.698      1 -total\n 43.59%   10.767      1 Template:Navigation\n 19.80%    4.890      1 Template:StorageBuildingsMenu\n  7.39%    1.825      1 Template:Languages\n  5.26%    1.298      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  4.67%    1.153